{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>MIRROR成員「教主」盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）向來是時尚界的寵兒，不時在社交平台分享時尚私服穿搭。日前Anson Lo在Instagram分享多張近照，寫道：「Recent good times:) October 2026, here’s to new beginnings💪🏻」，相片中他以斜揹一個約值10萬元的黑色Hermès Constance手袋出街，展現極強時尚氣派，吸引大批「神徒」點讚。</p><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo是名副其實的Hermès愛好者！（IG/@ansonlht）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184511341050990592536907.jpeg/c9mfmymdphXg3rdQifzTOIsslKNesn59Ll8B5C5fAeQ\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo是名副其實的Hermès愛好者！（IG/@ansonlht）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo是名副其實的Hermès愛好者！（IG/@ansonlht）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184511338207121408427531.jpeg/t_UZ1CziQ9H4Xh2YzYAuxdTvFZ7oPtOiCssEZgrLBGY\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo是名副其實的Hermès愛好者！（IG/@ansonlht）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo是名副其實的Hermès愛好者！（IG/@ansonlht）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184511335342280704953781.jpeg/R-A5RTDjNldJeKzwrL-YESKvCgf8VbaVjUsuzo1LLs4\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo是名副其實的Hermès愛好者！（IG/@ansonlht）</figcaption></figure><p>Anson Lo是名副其實的Hermès愛好者，其名牌手袋收藏庫陣容極為豪華，包括Hermès Mini Kelly、Hermès Birkin 30和Hermès Kelly 50 &amp; Lindy等等。從入行前月薪僅數千港元的舞蹈員，到如今成為香港頂流偶像，Anson Lo憑藉超高人氣，他獲Calvin Klein、Bulgari、Gucci等多個國際奢華品牌青睞，廣告合約與商演接演不斷，年收入被估計達千萬元級別，吸金能力非常厲害！</p><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo有不少名牌手袋！（IG/@ansonlht）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184511915800662016752864.jpeg/JcHpS7crievvSWuuOepsrEBN_MqG2orKlYE7ApWBOwI\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo有不少名牌手袋！（IG/@ansonlht）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo有不少名牌手袋！（IG/@ansonlht）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184511913594327040690348.jpeg/0sjfwlzincLLCH-EAzSn7UBFKJ5IxSq066N6QOujekA\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo有不少名牌手袋！（IG/@ansonlht）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo有不少名牌手袋！（IG/@ansonlht）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184511910968561664061923.jpeg/HXUejJ9BOjpTOZTs9gpAX0cLBPPAap2X2ff4fdn3-H0\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo有不少名牌手袋！（IG/@ansonlht）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo有不少名牌手袋！（IG/@ansonlht）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184512128405475328056428.jpeg/50xo6q3yWxEE3YI_ucKmYYc9AHEgrX5eKjdM8io3TPI\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo有不少名牌手袋！（IG/@ansonlht）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T01:20:21.761054+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":664,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}